<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container my-5">
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p class="text-muted">
        Last updated: 2026
    </p>

    <p>
        StayVerse is an online property listing and stay discovery platform.
        This project collects basic information required to provide its features,
        such as user account details, property listings, reviews and ratings.
    </p>

    <h5>Information We Collect</h5>
    <p>
        Users may provide information such as username and email address when
        creating an account. Property owners may also provide listing details,
        images and location information.
    </p>

    <h5>How We Use Information</h5>
    <p>
        The information is used to provide authentication, property listing,
        review, search and other StayVerse features.
    </p>

    <h5>Third-Party Services</h5>
    <p>
        StayVerse uses third-party services such as Cloudinary, Mapbox and
        Gemini AI to provide certain application features.
    </p>

    <h5>Contact</h5>
    <p>
        For questions regarding this policy, please contact the StayVerse
        project administrator.
    </p>
</div>